 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "There may be photos of him\non the internet.": "",
  "Well, there might be photos of him\non the internet...": "",
  "You seriously telling\nus to just... search him?": "",
  "So what, you want us to just\nsearch his name?": "",
  "Yes. Er, well, not exactly.\nTry looking up Vice Minister Ichinose.": "",
  "Er, well, not exactly.\nTry looking up Vice Minister Ichinose.": "",
  "Ishimatsu might have ended up\nin a photo of his at some point.": "",
  "You see, Ishimatsu's often seen with him.\nThey might be in a photo together...": "",
  "Mm, gotcha. Could take a while,\nbut I should be able to find somethin'.": "",
  "Gotcha. I can handle that,\nbut who knows how deep we'll have to dig.": "",
  "Kaito. Higashi.\nMind hanging back here with Kido?": "",
  "In that case, Kaito, Higashi.\nMind hanging back here with Kido?": "",
  "What about me then?": "",
  "What do I do?": "",
  "You get to tail Ishimatsu with me.\nYou're good at that kinda stuff, right?": "",
  "Guess so, yeah.\nWell, let's head to the Millennium Tower.": "",
  "Guess so... Well, we better get moving.\nTo the Millennium Tower!": "",
  "Be safe, you two. I'll send you a shot\nof Ishimatsu once I've got one.": "",
  "I'll send you a shot of Ishimatsu once I find one.\nCareful out there, you two.": "",
  "Great. Let's move out.": "",
  "Yo, it's Kaito.\nI just sent you the photo. Later.": "",
  "It's Kaito. Check your messages.\nJust sent you Ishimatsu's creepy mug. Later.": "",
  "So this is Ishimatsu, huh?\nGray suit, gloves...": "",
  "So that's our guy, huh?\nGray suit, gloves...": "",
  "We should be able to tell when\nhe's leaving from here.": "",
  "We'll see him leaving from\nup here no problem.": "",
  "Once he takes us there, we'll be ready\nto raid the lab. You good to go?": "",
  "...There's no turning back once we start\ntailin' Ishimatsu to the lab. You ready?": "",
  "Not just yet.\nWe can't afford to fail now.": "",
  "Right. I'll be on standby here in case\nhe comes out in the meantime.": "",
  "Guess not. Let me know—\nI'll be here on standby.": "",
  "We're in position, Kaito-san.\nTell Kido to make the call.": "",
  "Kaito-san. We're in position.\nTell Kido to make the call.": "",
  "Gotcha!": "",
  "It's time for your big\nacting debut, buddy.": "",
  "Well, time for your big\nacting debut, buddy.": "",
  "You there, Tak? Kido's call went off\nwithout a hitch. Ishimatsu's on the move.": "",
  "You there, Tak? Kido's call went off without a hitch.\nIshimatsu's on the move.": "",
  "Great. Now we just have\nto find him and follow him.": "",
  "Great. Now we just spot him\nand follow him.": "",
  "Don't fuck this up, man.": "",
  "Don't fuck it up, man.": "",
  "Don't worry.\nMe and Sugiura got it covered. ": "",
  "We've got this. Don't worry.": "",
  "Plan's good to go.\nJust gotta nail the execution...": "",
  "Plan's good to go...": "",
  "Get movin'. We'll have Kido make the call\nwhen you get to the Millennium Tower.": "",
  "Get movin'. When you reach the Millennium Tower,\nwe'll have Kido make the call.": "",
  "That'll lure Ishimatsu out no problem.": "",
  "Ugh, he's really on guard.": "",
  "A gray suit, gloves... That's him!": "",
  "Yeah. Thankfully that makes\nhim stand out even more.": "",
  "Yup. Thankfully that makes him\nstand out even more.": "",
  "He'll get suspicious if we stay too close.\nLet's back off a bit.": "",
  "How 'bout we switch for now? You go around\nand see if you can head where he's goin'.": "",
  "Okay, how 'bout we switch for now?\nYou see if you can head where he's goin'.": "",
  "There he is.\nComing right towards me.": "",
  "Ishimatsu's right there.\nComing right toward me.": "",
  "All right. It's all on you now.": "",
  "(Is that Ishimatsu...? Nah.)": "",
  "...Monsieur Lee?": "",
  "It's a love hotel that closed down years ago.\nPerfect place to set up a mad scientist's lab.": "",
  "It's a love hotel that closed down years ago.\nPerfect place for some secret experiments.": "",
  "Kaito-san, it's me.": "",
  "It's me, Kaito-san.": "",
  "You find the place?": "",
  "Hey. You find the place?": "",
  "We've got a building that looks the part,\nat least. We're gonna head in.": "",
  "A building that looks the part, at least.\nWe're gonna head in.": "",
  "Be careful, man.": "",
  "Yup, let's do it.": "",
  "Yeah. We're going in.": "",
  "Geez, it's dark.\nWhat's the deal with this place...?": "",
  "Hey, you think this counts\nas trespassing?": "",
  "Huh? Who the hell are you!?": "",
  "Yagami-san!\nWhat do we do?": "",
  "What's the plan, Yagami-san!?": "",
  "Only one thing to do.\nWe fight!": "",
  "I say we tear through 'em!": "",
  "I bet those weren't the last of 'em, Yagami-san.\nIf anything that was just the welcoming party.": "",
  "Well, I bet those weren't the last of 'em.\nIf anything, that was just the welcoming party.": "",
  "They'll know we're here, too. Probably have\nweapons next time. Guns, worst case scenario.": "",
  "They'll know we're here, too.\nThey'll be armed. Maybe even with guns.": "",
  "Who are these guys anyway?": "",
  "Bums off the street, if I had to guess.\nIchinose must've offered them a lot to do this...": "",
  "If I had to guess... the homeless of Kamurocho.\nProbably offered big payouts from Ichinose's pocket.": "",
  "Yo, you guys okay in there?": "",
  "Yo, you okay in there, Tak?": "",
  "Yup, we're right on track.": "",
  "They've got guards, too.\nThere's gotta be something here.": "",
  "Something like a secret lab, maybe?": "",
  "Shono's secret lab? ": "",
  "It'd be the perfect place.": "",
  "There's even a car here.\nIt'd be the perfect place.": "",
  "It's so dark, you could carry a corpse\nin here and nobody'd ever know.": "",
  "It's dark enough that you could\ncarry a corpse through unnoticed.": "",
  "Think you two can handle\nit on your own?": "",
  "Think you two can handle it?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Are the two of us going to be able to\nget evidence of the secret lab by ourselves?)</color>": "",
  "Actually...": "",
  "I just thought of something. Can you call\nMafuyu for me? Get her over here.": "",
  "Here's a thought... Can you call Mafuyu for me,\nand send her over?": "",
  "And tell her to bring the cops.": "",
  "Tell her to bring the cops.": "",
  "Huh? Sure that's wise?": "",
  "Well think about it.\nWe're trespassing, yeah?": "",
  "I figure we're trespassing, yeah?": "",
  "Even if we do stumble on Shono's secret lab,\nthe court would never accept evidence found illegally.": "",
  "Even if we're right, and we do stumble on Shono's lab,\nthe court would never accept evidence found illegally.": "",
  "And calling the cops...\nmakes it all fuckin' better?": "",
  "And you think... calling the cops is gonna help?": "",
  "Not exactly. Even they can't\ninvestigate without a warrant.": "",
  "Not exactly. Even they can't investigate\nwithout a warrant.": "",
  "Then why the hell're you tryin'\nto get Mafuyu-chan over there?": "",
  "That's my point. So why the hell're you\ntryin' to get Mafuyu-chan over there?": "",
  "I've got an idea.": "",
  "I think I've got a workaround.": "",
  "Just talk to Mafuyu for me, okay?\nWe'll keep looking for the lab.": "",
  "Ugh, it's dark.": "",
  "Hold on. We shouldn't go in there\nwithout a light.": "",
  "Who knows what's gonna be in here.\nLet's be careful.": "",
  "Who knows what's gonna be in here.\nWatch your step.": "",
  "Dammit, I stepped in a puddle.": "",
  "Gah, how come there's puddles in here?": "",
  "...For a door that doesn't even open.": "",
  "In front of doors that don't open no less!": "",
  "Didn't I tell you to be careful?": "",
  "I warned you, didn't I?": "",
  "I really like these shoes, too...": "",
  "Dammit, I really liked these shoes...": "",
  "(A mechanized door... Might be able to short it out\nif I run electricity through this puddle.)": "",
  "(They're sparking. Gotta be careful\nif I don't wanna to get shocked.)": "",
  "Keep it down, Sugiura.\nYou're gonna give me a heart attack.": "",
  "Could you keep the outbursts to a minimum!?\nYou're gonna give me a heart attack.": "",
  "The hell? Can't you see I'm tryin'\nto have some fun here!?": "",
  "I'm tryin' to have some fun here!\nDon't interrupt!": "",
  "I give him three minutes.\nThen he's just another body!": "",
  "I give him about three minutes...\n'til he's just another body!": "",
  "Aww, only two more minutes\n'til the pain's over!": "",
  "I give him about two minutes...\n'til he's just another body!": "",
  "Tick tock! One minute to live!": "",
  "I give him about one minute...\n'til he's just another body!": "",
  "(I can't abandon Sugiura!)": "",
  "Sugiura! Are you okay!?": "",
  "Are you okay!?": "",
  "...Yeah, somehow.\nI owe you one, man.": "",
  "...Yeah, somehow.\nI owe you one.": "",
  "Don't mention it.\nC'mon, let's keep going.": "",
  "Good... Let's keep going.": "",
  "How do you like this!?": "",
  "Now's my chance!": "",
  "There... Now's our chance.": "",
  "Yagami-san!\nThat didn't even leave a scratch!": "",
  "Yagami-san! That didn't even\nleave a scratch!": "",
  "Good. Can't say I was thrilled\nabout becoming a murderer.": "",
  "That's fine. Can't say I was thrilled\nabout becoming a murderer.": "",
  "You look worse than I was expecting.\nI hear Kuroiwa paid you a visit.": "",
  "You look worse than I was expecting.\nI hear Kuroiwa paid you a visit?": "",
  "Yup, just him and that baton he's got.\nBeat the shit out of us.": "",
  "Yup, just him and his blackjack.\nStill beat the shit outta us.": "",
  "He took Kido, too.\nHow'd things go with your stuff?": "",
  "He took Kido on his way out, too.\nHow'd things go with your stuff?": "",
  "We found Shono's lab. But the police\nare basically refusing to investigate it.": "",
  "We found Shono's lab.\nBut... the police refuse to investigate.": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor Morita's\ndefending AD-9.": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor Morita's defending AD-9.": "",
  "You for real?": "",
  "Whatever evidence was there is\nprobably long gone by now.": "",
  "Whatever evidence <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> there...\nis probably long gone by now.": "",
  "Right. There's something else\nI need to tell you, too.": "",
  "...There's something else I need to\ntell you, too.": "",
  "What is it? This have something\nto do with Sugiura?": "",
  "What? Something about Sugiura?": "",
  "Yeah, uh. That's...\nnot actually his name.": "",
  "Yeah. Turns out...\nhis name isn't \"Sugiura.\"": "",
  "So you're Emi Terasawa's\nlittle brother, huh?": "",
  "So... you're Emi Terasawa's\nlittle brother, huh?": "",
  "Why'd you keep it a secret?": "",
  "At first... I wanted to make\nYagami-san remember.": "",
  "At first... I just wanted to make\nYagami-san remember.": "",
  "Remember what?": "",
  "How he let my sister suffer.": "",
  "In my eyes, he was a scumbag who let a murderer walk.\nThe murderer who then burned Emi to death.": "",
  "I thought he was a scumbag who let a murderer walk.\nThe murderer who then burned Emi to death.": "",
  "Damn. That's heavy.": "",
  "Damn...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(From Sugiura's point of view, my\nactions directly led to Emi's death.)</color>": "",
  "Go on. You don't have to hold back.": "",
  "Back then, I was just a shut-in fuckup.\nMy life was in shambles.": "",
  "At the time...\nI was just some shut-in fuckup.": "",
  "Emi was still there for me, though.\nWhen nobody else was.": "",
  "But even when I had nobody,\nI still had Emi in my corner.": "",
  "And then, somebody murdered her.\nSomeone as nice as Emi, dead, for no reason.": "",
  "And then... somebody murdered her.\nSomeone as nice as Emi... dead, for no reason.": "",
  "But the world doesn't stop for that shit. It just\nkeeps turning, and people go about their business.": "",
  "But the world doesn't stop for that shit.\nIt just keeps turning without mercy.": "",
  "Over time I started to hate\nwhat our whole society stood for.": "",
  "Over time, I started to hate\nwhat our society stood for.": "",
  "So I'm guessing... That's what led you\nto start that burglary ring?": "",
  "And... that's why you turned to crime?": "",
  "At the very least, I didn't wanna keep\nliving my life for other people.": "",
  "At the very least, I didn't wanna keep\nlivin' my life for other people.": "",
  "Y'know, when Emi died... Yagami-san didn't\napologize. Not to me, or to my parents.": "",
  "Y'know, when Emi died... Yagami-san\ndidn't apologize. Not to me, or to my parents.": "",
  "So that's when you guys first met, huh?": "",
  "So... that's when you guys first met?\nBack then?": "",
  "Yup. I looked totally different back then, though.\nHad glasses and long hair so you couldn't really see my face.": "",
  "Yup. I looked totally different back then, though.\nHad glasses and long hair, so you couldn't really see my face.": "",
  "That's why I didn't recognize you.": "",
  "\"Defending a murderer?\nYou're just as guilty as he is!\"": "",
  "Those words cut deeper than you\nprobably could have imagined.": "",
  "I remember your words. They hit hard.\nHarder than you might have realized.": "",
  "Even so, Okubo insisted\nhe didn't do it.": "",
  "Even so, Okubo insisted he didn't do it.": "",
  "And since I was his lawyer, I couldn't apologize.\nThat would essentially be admitting he was guilty.": "",
  "And since I was his lawyer, I couldn't apologize.\nIf I had... that would have been admitting Okubo's guilt.": "",
  "What about after the trial?": "",
  "So, what about after the trial?": "",
  "I didn't apologize then, either.": "",
  "...I didn't apologize then, either.": "",
  "Instead... I ran away.\nPut it all behind me. ": "",
  "Instead... I tried to put it all behind me. ": "",
  "Right. You didn't just walk away.\nYou practically got disbarred.": "",
  "No denying that. You didn't just leave the courtroom...\nYou practically got disbarred.": "",
  "At least Okubo was getting the death penalty.\nIt didn't feel good, but... I settled for that.": "",
  "At least Okubo was getting the death penalty.\nIt didn't feel good... but I settled for that.": "",
  "Then why'd you start hangin'\naround Tak again?": "",
  "Then... why'd you start coming 'round\nTak again?": "",
  "Because he found his way back to the courtroom\nto deal with all this Mole business.": "",
  "Because... Yagami-san was back in court\nfor all this Mole business.": "",
  "Even got a yakuza captain off the hook.": "",
  "Well it's not like I suddenly just\nbecame a lawyer again.": "",
  "I wasn't staging some big comeback.": "",
  "Sure seemed that way from my perspective.": "",
  "Sure seemed that way\nfrom my perspective.": "",
  "...So, I wanted to see where your head was at.\nFind out if you'd forgotten what you did to Emi.": "",
  "...That's why. I wanted to see where your head was at.\nFind out if you'd forgotten what you did to Emi.": "",
  "If you were gonna pretend like nothing\nhappened, I'd make you remember.": "",
  "If you were gonna pretend like nothing happened,\nI'd make you remember what you did.": "",
  "And I'd make you pay for it.": "",
  "...And make you pay.": "",
  "And that's why you approached me.": "",
  "Yup. I wanted to know what\nOkubo was up to, too.": "",
  "I wanted to know what Okubo\nwas up to, as well.": "",
  "Find out if he was as afraid of death\nas he should've been.": "",
  "Make sure he was as scared\nto die as he deserved to be.": "",
  "If anyone was gonna go\nsee him, it was you.": "",
  "If anyone was gonna go see him,\nI figured it was you.": "",
  "But now it's lookin' more and more\nlikely Okubo was framed.": "",
  "But now... it's lookin' more and more likely\nOkubo was framed.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "What do I do?": "ฉันจะทำยังไงดี?",
  "Gotcha!": "เข้าใจแล้วครับ!",
  "Huh? Who the hell are you!?": "หา? แกเป็นใครวะ!?",
  "Actually...": "ที่จริง...",
  "Are you okay!?": "เธอไม่เป็นไรนะ!?",
  "Now's my chance!": "โอกาสของกูมาแล้ว!",
  "Damn...": "เวรเอ๊ย..."
 }
}
